[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[4dYou've heard about them from others. You've even had them yourself: classes that seem to last\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "forever. But this one takes the biscuit. You wonder what possessed you to sign up for \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3mCeltic\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "Elements in Early Teutonic Settlements\u001b(B\u001b[m: a field of study so narrow and boring, you'd wonder they\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "would award doctorates in it. But they must, for the chap running the lecture has one.\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "You glance down at the notebook in your hands, but the thought of recording all this boredom for\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "posterity doesn't thrill you. Instead, you look around the hall, wondering if you could sneak out\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "and find something better to do with your time.\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mRisorgimento Represso\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mAn Interactive Invigoration\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "Copyright (c) 2003,2006,2017 by Michael J. Coyne.\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "Players new to Interactive Fiction should type HELP for instructions on how to play.\r\u001b[19dRelease 6 / Serial number 171114 / Inform v6.33 Library v6.12.1\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "This work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs-NonCommercial License. Type\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "LICENSE to find out more about the terms of the license.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mLecture Hall\u001b(B\u001b[m (on the seat)\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "An ordinary, run-of-the-mill lecture hall. Its many banks of tiered seats run up towards the large\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "and heavy double doors at the west end. Down at floor level, at the east end of the hall, the\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "professor is teaching the lesson. Tiers upon tiers of bored students sit in the seats.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "An empty cup of yogurt, the remains of your elevenses, sits on the desk.\r\u001b[30d[MORE]"]
[2.503, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m Lecture Hall                                                            Score: 0     Moves: 0      \u001b[30;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m>\u001b[K"]
