[0.000, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001b[1;94H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m1\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mThe professor is dressed in the same clothes he's been wearing since the start of term. He is\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "standing by the overhead projector and droning on and on.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"Now if you remember, in the course syllabus, I mentioned we would begin by discussing the settling\r\u001b[28dinstincts of early German nomad tribes,\" lectures the professor.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.413, "o", "s"]
[0.090, "o", "t"]
[0.091, "o", "a"]
[0.090, "o", "n"]
[0.091, "o", "d"]
[0.090, "o", " "]
[0.091, "o", "u"]
[0.091, "o", "p"]
[0.090, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001b[1;94H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m2\r\u001b[24d\u001b(B\u001b[m\"Students shall please remain seated while the lecture is in progress,\" intones the professor as you\u001b[25;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "stand up.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"It's fascinating to note that as the early Teutons shifted from nomads to village-dwellers, they\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "started by building huts,\" declaims the professor.\r\u001b[30d"]
[0.001, "o", ">"]
[2.412, "o", "s"]
[0.091, "o", "i"]
[0.090, "o", "t"]
[0.091, "o", " "]
[0.090, "o", "d"]
[0.091, "o", "o"]
[0.090, "o", "w"]
[0.091, "o", "n"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[6M\u001b[1;94H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m3\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[mYou slide quietly back into your seat.\r\u001b[27d\"But what is particularly fascinating is the fact that, under some circumstances...\" intones the\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "professor.\r\u001b[30d>"]
