[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m4\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[mThe students look extremely bored, disinterested and dispirited.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"... and some very unique conditions, when parts of these huts have collapsed in certain ways...\"\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "drawls the professor.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "You really feel you must get out of this room.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.412, "o", "l"]
