[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m5\r\u001b[20d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mLecture Hall\u001b(B\u001b[m (on the seat)\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "An ordinary, run-of-the-mill lecture hall. Its many banks of tiered seats run up towards the large\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "and heavy double doors at the west end. Down at floor level, at the east end of the hall, the\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "professor is teaching the lesson. Tiers upon tiers of bored students sit in the seats.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "An empty cup of yogurt, the remains of your elevenses, sits on the desk.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"... they could, by expert scholars, be reasoned to have been built in the shape of early Celtic\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "crosses,\" mumbles the professor.\r\u001b[30d>"]
